      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NO STOP SIGNS (1) was safely held last time out, finishing eighth at this track over 600m behind MAGIC LOKI (35.37) in a Grade 4/5. Got the money at his only try from this box. Should bounce back. CACO MAGIC (2) stalked the lead from a middle draw and boxed on well to finish 1.3 lengths back in third (34.66) at this track in a Grade 4/5 over 600m. Expecting another good run. EVENTUATE (5) was a last start winner (29.61) at Sandown who is building a strong winning record. Has never missed the frame at the trip from six starts. Winner at her latest appearance in one of the quickest times on the card. Has definite claims. MAGIC LOKI (6) showed great speed to lead all the way last start. Will give a great sight.",
